{"ts": "2025-12-14T06:30:40.983989Z", "level": "INFO", "event": "TASK.TRADE.PROCESSING", "event_code": "TASK.TRADE.PROCESSING", "trace_id": "TRC-20251214063040-bac9e11b6702", "service": "task_manager", "msg": "处理TRADE阶段任务", "extra": {"task_id": 638, "metadata": {"market": {"id": "916396", "question": "Will Alison Loehnis be the next CEO of Lululemon?", "slug": "will-alison-loehnis-be-the-next-ceo-of-lululemon", "outcomes": "[\"Yes\", \"No\"]", "outcome_prices": "[\"0.05\", \"0.95\"]", "active": true, "volume": "88.143251", "liquidity": "115.0317", "end_date": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z", "tau": 381, "tags": [], "marks": [], "negRisk": true, "clobTokenIds": "[\"34470565453221221632628113919209543583753575648519139473583648575217835182188\", \"58155400519585082926280613952470400731105507303935428728749771764451502376394\"]"}, "analysis": {"p": 0.05, "n": 0.95, "a": 0.75, "reasons_y": ["She is an independent director with a long career in luxury and fashion e-commerce at Yoox Net-a-Porter and other consumer brands, giving her strong digital and brand credentials. citeturn0search8turn0search13", "Lululemon’s challenges include sharpening product and brand relevance, where her luxury and online fashion background could be attractive. citeturn1news55turn1news58", "Boards sometimes recruit sitting or interim CEOs from adjacent fashion and retail companies to lead a turnaround."], "reasons_n": ["She is currently an ad-interim CEO and president at Yoox Net-a-Porter, so leaving that role for Lululemon would require a complex negotiation. citeturn0search13turn0search8", "Her role on Lululemon’s board has been non-executive; there is no public indication that she is being groomed as an internal succession candidate. citeturn0search8turn1search3", "The board already has interim co-CEOs from inside the C-suite, which may be seen as more natural CEO successors than an external luxury e-commerce leader. citeturn1news56turn1search18"]}, "source_analysis_task_id": 631, "marks": []}, "result": {"decision": "skip", "reason": "根据Kelly准则，当前市场不值得交易", "wealth": 100.0}}}
