{"ts": "2025-12-14T06:31:04.823445Z", "level": "INFO", "event": "TASK.TRADE.PROCESSING", "event_code": "TASK.TRADE.PROCESSING", "trace_id": "TRC-20251214063104-d21ce4f389fa", "service": "task_manager", "msg": "处理TRADE阶段任务", "extra": {"task_id": 637, "metadata": {"market": {"id": "916397", "question": "Will Teri List be the next CEO of Lululemon?", "slug": "will-teri-list-be-the-next-ceo-of-lululemon", "outcomes": "[\"Yes\", \"No\"]", "outcome_prices": "[\"0.15\", \"0.85\"]", "active": true, "volume": "76.49", "liquidity": "140.5437", "end_date": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z", "tau": 381, "tags": [], "marks": [], "negRisk": true, "clobTokenIds": "[\"20444638481489447516300051581418369056007507822459509684472762453013814813915\", \"67976487436204321978647494564100550496573757374842616457745374548391179141293\"]"}, "analysis": {"p": 0.1, "n": 0.9, "a": 0.75, "reasons_y": ["She joined the lululemon board in 2024 and is already a seasoned director at Microsoft, Visa, and Danaher, with deep finance and governance experience. citeturn0search3turn0search7turn0search12", "Her background as a CFO and board member at large global companies fits investors’ desire for disciplined capital allocation and operational rigor during a turnaround. citeturn0search17turn1news55", "Boards sometimes elevate trusted financial and governance experts from within the board when they want a conservative, risk-aware leader."], "reasons_n": ["Her current profile is that of a professional director with multiple board commitments, not an active full-time operator, making a CEO move less likely. citeturn0search7turn0search17", "The company is facing brand and product challenges that may call for a leader with stronger merchandising or consumer-brand credentials than a boardroom-focused financial profile. citeturn1news56turn0news63turn1news58", "The use of an external search firm signals a strong intent to look beyond the current board for operating talent. citeturn1search0turn1search22